      "font size" : 11.955,
      "text color" : "[0.0]",
      "content" : "• X is less than Y in the convolution order, shortly written as X ≤CONV Y if Y =ST X + Z where Z is a nonnegative random variable independent of X (see [12], p. 70 and [13]).",
